solutions.body:
The missing square is at the right end of the middle row. Check which lines must cross its edges:
- the kangaroo's back comes in from the **left edge, near the top**;
- the head above ends at the **top edge, close to the left corner** (the neck);
- the front leg below continues out of the **bottom-left corner**.

Square (B) has a small piece at the top-left corner and one curve from the top down to the bottom-left corner — exactly these lines.

**Answer: (B)**
